              "line": 3,
              "heading": "ZX Bank Lucknow Branch Network"
            },
            "text": "ZX Bank has established a comprehensive banking network across Lucknow, ensuring residents of every major region—North, South, East, West, and Central Lucknow—can access modern banking services with ease. With 22 strategically located branches, customers benefit from seamless banking, personalized advisory, and digital services across the city. The following tables provide details of ZX Bank’s branch locations, IFSC codes, and contact numbers, organized by region for convenience."
